<title>UK: SGA sets warrants on 14 Swiss blue chips.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on 14 Swiss blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued 20 tranches, American-style call and put warrants on 14 Swiss blue chip companies, lead manager Societe Generale Bank and Trust, Zurich said.</p>
<p>The companies included are ABB AB, Alusuisse, Baloise, CS Holding, Elektrowatt, Nestle, Roche Genusschein, SBC, Sulzer, Swissair, Swiss Reinsurance, UBS, Winterthur and Zurich Insurance.</p>
<p>There is a minimum exercise of 100 warrants and a paydate of December 11, 1996. Prices will be quoted on Reuters page SGECHFO</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
